; Opening beneath a directory (`Sys.sysOpenBeneath`) and making the
; links it refuses to follow (`Sys.sysSymlink`). Added 2026-09-26.
; ------------------------------------------------------------------
;; no syscall ABI: `Sys.ax` reaches the `__syscallN` trap for files, as for every file call here
